{
  "name": "Lumia Clavilux",
  "promptTemplate": "A Thomas Wilfred lumia study of {{palette}} silk veils, {{veil_count}} folding ribbons drifting at {{drift_speed}}x speed with {{undulation}} complexity in a {{focal_depth}} formation, with sheer translucence set to {{sheer_veil}}.",
