  "listing": {
    "section": "generative",
    "blurb": "Luminous silk veils drift and fold in deep absolute dark, emulating Thomas Wilfred's mechanical clavilux optical organs.",
    "prompt": "A Lumia composition in the manner of Thomas Wilfred: soft, slow, veil-like forms of coloured light unfurling and folding in the dark like silk in a current, never repeating, deep blacks around them. Make it striking on a big projected wall in a dark room: a bold composition, rich colour against real blacks, depth, glow, and motion that reads from across the room. Keep a demoscener's economy: lookup tables and fixed-size buffers kept in room.state, low-resolution offscreen buffers for any per-pixel work, nothing allocated inside hot loops, a steady 60fps at 1920x1080, and compact, clearly named code.",
    "look": [
      "calm",
      "light",
      "organic"
    ],
    "source": "lightworks/lumia~2"
  }
